# Billing, Plans & Payments

## Canonical plans (`PlanSeeder`)

Prices are **major units** (USD dollars), not cents. Period totals use volume discounts.

| Plan | Monthly | 3 months | 6 months (−10%) | 12 months (−20%) | AI credits / mo |
|------|--------:|---------:|----------------:|-----------------:|----------------:|
| Starter | 39 | 117 | 210.60 | 374.40 | 2,500 |
| Pro | 99 | 297 | 534.60 | 950.40 | 40,000 |
| Enterprise | 249 | 747 | 1,344.60 | 2,390.40 | Unlimited |

## AI reasoning credit costs (`config/flowdesk.php` → `ai_task_credits`)

| Action | Credits |
|--------|--------:|
| Nova voice TTS (`nova_voice`) | 5 |
| Nova briefing (`nova_briefing`) | 20 |
| Nova chat / standard reasoning (`nova_chat`) | 100 |
| Assistant default / summary | 60 |
| Growth advisors / report counsel | 125 |
| Line-item / document scans | 160 |
| Pay-per-use estimate | **2¢** per credit (`FLOWDESK_AI_CREDIT_PRICE_MINOR`) |

## Usage Tracking Pattern
```php
// Check BEFORE creating a resource
UsageTracker::check('projects', $company); // throws PlanLimitException
$project = Project::create([...$data, 'company_id' => $company->id]);
UsageTracker::increment('projects', $company);
```

## CheckPlanLimit Middleware
```php
Route::post('/projects', [ProjectController::class, 'store'])
    ->middleware('plan.limit:projects');
```

## Payment Providers
```
Stripe     → Primary global payments (cards, SEPA)
PayPal     → Secondary global option
Flouci     → Tunisia local payments
Bank       → Manual bank transfer (confirmed by admin)
```

## Subscription Lifecycle
```
trial_started → trial_active → trial_ended
                                    ↓
                             subscription_created
                                    ↓
                    active → past_due → cancelled
                      ↓
                   upgraded / downgraded
```
